  "name": "travis-core",
  "description": "Central domain logic and persistence layer for the Travis CI platform, encapsulating the business logic for build lifecycle management and repository synchronization. It provides an ActiveRecord-based relational schema and a multi-versioned API for coordinating events between GitHub webhooks and internal worker processes. The system implements a robust event-driven architecture for multi-channel notification dispatch and state orchestration across a distributed build environment.",
